---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
const gallery = [
  ['roots','Root mass removed during drainage work. Root removal restores space in the pipe; inspection helps assess the entry point.'],
  ['camera','CCTV equipment at an accessible drain opening. A clear view helps explain suitable next steps.'],
  ['jetting','A stocked service vehicle and drainage hose equipment at the job.'],
  ['bedded-pipe','Exposed pipework supported in prepared bedding before backfilling.'],
  ['junction','Drainage junctions and connections visible during installation.'],
  ['pipe-repair','Replacement drainage pipe and access fittings beside the property.'],
  ['excavation','Access to pipework during excavation and repair.'],
  ['finished-gully','A finished surface around a gully grate and inspection opening.'],
  ['stocked-truck','Tools and fittings organised in the Antons service vehicle.'],
];
---
<Layout title="Our Drainage Work | Real Antons Photos & Kurrajong Videos" description="See the Antons team at work: root removal, CCTV drain inspection, pipe repairs and Kurrajong job videos. Explore our drainage equipment and practical work." crumbs={[{name:'Our work',href:'/our-work'}]}>
  <div class="wrap intro-page"><h1>Real work.<br /><span class="blue">A closer look at the capability.</span></h1><p>From the obstruction we remove to the pipework we install, these photographs show the Antons team’s practical drainage work.</p><p class="fine">A selection of work from across the Antons service network. Job locations are identified where confirmed.</p></div><section class="wrap section" style="padding-top:0" aria-label="Drainage job photographs"><div class="gallery">{gallery.map(([name,caption])=><figure><Photo name={name} alt={caption} sizes="(max-width:760px) 45vw, 30vw" /><figcaption>{caption}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section related"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>From the team’s<br />Kurrajong footage.</h2><p>A look at our drainage work in Kurrajong, outside the Northern Beaches. The same wider Antons team, on another job.</p></div><div class="video-grid"><article><video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/images/kurrajong-overflow-poster.webp" aria-label="Kurrajong blocked overflow gully job video"><source src="/videos/kurrajong-overflow.mp4" type="video/mp4" /><p><a href="/videos/kurrajong-overflow.mp4">Open the Kurrajong overflow video</a></p></video><h3>Blocked overflow gully</h3><p>The team working on drainage in Kurrajong. If a gully is overflowing at your property, stop using affected fixtures and arrange an assessment to identify the cause.</p></article><article><video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/images/kurrajong-reel-poster.webp" aria-label="Antons Plumbing and Gas Kurrajong job reel"><source src="/videos/kurrajong-reel.mp4" type="video/mp4" /><p><a href="/videos/kurrajong-reel.mp4">Open the Kurrajong job reel</a></p></video><h3>Antons at work in Kurrajong</h3><p>Another view of our team and equipment on the job. The drainage solution for your property depends on inspection, pipe condition and safe access.</p></article></div></div></section><Cta />
</Layout>
